msgid "Update"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Today, we released Quarkus 3.13.3, our third maintenance release for the 3."
"13 release train."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This release contains bugfixes and documentation improvements.\n"
"It should be a safe upgrade for anyone already using 3.13."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"One important change is that we downgraded Apache Commons Lang from 3.16.0 "
"to 3.14.0,\n"
"because of a change in behavior as to the default source of entropy.\n"
"It is causing some severe issues (including the application completely "
"stalling),\n"
"in particular with https://github.com/liquibase/liquibase/issues/"
"6178[Liquibase]."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You can find more information about this issue https://issues.apache.org/"
"jira/browse/LANG-1748[here].\n"
"We will wait for the Java ecosystem to adapt to this change before upgrading "
"again."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"To update to Quarkus 3.13, we recommend updating to the latest version of "
"the Quarkus CLI and run:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Note that `quarkus update` can update your applications from any version of "
"Quarkus (including 2.x) to Quarkus 3.13."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you are not already using 3.13, please refer to the https://github.com/"
"quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-3.13[3.13] migration guide."
msgstr ""

msgid "Full changelog"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You can get https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/3.13.3[the "
"full changelog of 3.13.3 on GitHub]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Come Join Us"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We value your feedback a lot so please report bugs, ask for improvements... "
"Let's build something great together!"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you are a Quarkus user or just curious, don't be shy and join our "
"welcoming community:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"provide feedback on https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"craft some code and https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pulls[push a PR];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"discuss with us on https://quarkusio.zulipchat.com/[Zulip] and on the https:/"
"/groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[mailing list];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"ask your questions on https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/"
"quarkus[Stack Overflow]."
msgstr ""
